{{!
    @template auth_moowoodle/step

    A single setup wizard step: a heading, an introduction paragraph, an
    optional notification, the step's form, and optional trailing content
    (e.g. a "Next" button for steps with nothing to submit).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading - plain text step heading.
    * intro - plain text introduction paragraph.
    * notification - pre-rendered notification HTML, or empty.
    * formhtml - pre-rendered moodleform HTML.
    * extra - pre-rendered trailing HTML (e.g. a button), or empty.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "Web Service",
        "intro": "Create or reuse an external service.",
        "notification": "",
        "formhtml": "<form>...</form>",
        "extra": ""
    }
}}
<h3>{{heading}}</h3>
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{{notification}}}
{{{formhtml}}}
{{{extra}}}
